      "width": 1247,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "The CLI writes with the server stopped. If both processes write at once, SQLite's write lock serializes them, and the waiter retries for up to 5 s.",
      "originalText": "The CLI writes with the server stopped. If both processes write at once, SQLite's write lock serializes them, and the waiter retries for up to 5 s.",
