      "y": 1276,
      "width": 1213,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "A CLI write reaches open desktop apps because the SSE route rereads op_log every 250 ms. There is no file watcher and no IPC between processes.",
      "originalText": "A CLI write reaches open desktop apps because the SSE route rereads op_log every 250 ms. There is no file watcher and no IPC between processes.",
